   "roundness": null,
   "text": "docs/product/<slug>.md gains an OPTIONAL section:\n## Grounding\n- <ref> \u2014 <why>   (ref = path or glob from repo root)\nthe audit gains AU5: every declared ref resolves on disk, or the\npush goes red naming the doc and the broken reference.",
