   "roundness": null,
   "text": "READ-RECEIPTS at gates: slice 2, carrying the hollow-stamping\nrow and the retrieval-not-comprehension claim.\nRUNG-SCOPED grounding + any static floor: slice 2's extension\npoint, taken only if receipts need it.\nORPHAN REPORT (artifacts no grounding names): unframed.\nCOMPREHENSION PROOFS: never, per the ledger's third row.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "READ-RECEIPTS at gates: slice 2, carrying the hollow-stamping\nrow and the retrieval-not-comprehension claim.\nRUNG-SCOPED grounding + any static floor: slice 2's extension\npoint, taken only if receipts need it.\nORPHAN REPORT (artifacts no grounding names): unframed.\nCOMPREHENSION PROOFS: never, per the ledger's third row.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
